{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21066","headline":"自古无长生劝姚合酒 · 刘叉","name":"自古无长生劝姚合酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"奉子一杯酒，爲子照颜色。\n但愿腮上红，莫管颏下白。\n自古无长生，生者何戚戚。\n登山勿厌高，四望都无极。\n丘陇逐日多，天地爲我窄。\n祗见李耳书，对之空脉脉。\n何曾见天上，着得刘安宅。\n若问长生人，昭昭孔丘籍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘叉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21066.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21066","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}